{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_02_beg","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_02","title":"拓荒者小屋","storyCode":"DV-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b64262ae9809ebf3ef15036e59efd60c4186017dbdefc9591d0b4cfaafa98970","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"借著白面鴞暈倒而進入基地的赫默一行人與拓荒者們接觸，就在僵局即將被打破之際，眾人遭到神秘生物的襲擊。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我的人生就再沒有其他出路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生？領隊先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是不太舒服嗎？我聽到您的呼吸很急促。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，我沒有惡意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是和赫默醫生一起進來的，您的隊員們都檢查過了，我們沒有攜帶危險的武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。我只是出於習慣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您沒必要道歉。我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逐漸蔓延的黑暗會讓人情緒緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要不要離我近一點？人多的地方會暖和一些，這樣的話，就算忍不住睡過去了，也不至於會被凍僵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生的醫療無人機裝配有應急電源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她正在屋子裡為白面鴞小姐檢查身體，埃琳娜小姐也和她們在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩姆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他聽從您的安排，把身體不太好的拓荒者們都集中到室內了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想拜託你一件事。不要告訴薩姆和其他人，我剛剛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是領隊，在這個節骨眼上，要是他們知道您體力不支，拓荒隊內部可能會失控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不是想說拓荒隊不夠團結，只是......黑暗往往會催生變數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你很有經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是玻利瓦爾人。在我過去生活的那座城市裡，停電是常有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玻利瓦爾......戰亂地區？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的家鄉，我們很難說清楚，戰火會在哪裡暫時停下腳步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能從那個地方走出來，你很不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是同事們幫助了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，您和其他拓荒隊的人更了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......了不起？哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您笑什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來那幾家公司的廣告已經一路打到玻利瓦爾去了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是這個意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，您靠自己的雙腿走到了這裡。而您的前輩們，那些來自維多利亞、高盧和玻利瓦爾的移民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是各位的足跡點亮了這片荒野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......你還很會說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？我只是實話實說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在來之前，我就一直想看看哥倫比亞大名鼎鼎的拓荒區是什麼模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你失望了嗎？這裡說不定比你的家鄉還要荒涼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，領隊先生，我還是學到了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說，你們的電源線路設計果然和Mechanist先生說得一樣，簡潔且有效率啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警長，載具準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶上防具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛看見了，他們手上有自製手弩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等天更黑一點，派幾架無人機先靠近拓荒者居住區，確認人質和匪徒各自所在位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們跟在後面，找個好時機攻進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......赫默研究員和那個羅德島的幹員呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定他們站在哪一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是你們萊茵生命的做事方法嗎？不管做什麼事，都要先選邊站？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是想確保問題得到解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警長，這就是防衛科的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我的職責是救人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好，我不管你們想幹什麼，你們最好也不要妨礙我的工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，是羅德島的人救了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島不僅僅救下了當時差點在事故中死去的我，還給了我繼續學習的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能成長為現在的我，全靠羅德島改變了我的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......真是一家不錯的公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是眼下這情形，我會以為這是什麼招聘宣講會現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......桑尼先生，要是您有這方面想法的話，真的可以向羅德島投遞履歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，一個拓荒者，現在恐怕還成了綁架犯......向你描述中這麼好的公司投遞履歷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別拿我開玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再怎麼謙虛，我也能看出來，你是一個多麼富有潛力的工程師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更別提你那三位同事......她們身為感染者，還能被萊茵生命雇傭，你知道這有多難嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......她們的確很優秀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不止是優秀。她們是萬裡挑一，在各自領域出類拔萃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每年有那麼多感染者，只有極少數天才能得到“赦免”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是羅德島......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，格雷伊先生，你想說，“羅德島救人的時候並沒有那麼嚴苛的條件”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我願意相信你，相信你對救你一命的公司有特別的信心，相信它願意違背自己追逐利益的天性，無差別地對待每一個感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是無法否認，你也是那個被選中的幸運兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的倒楣蛋，要嘛被圈養起來等著泥水沒過頭頂，要嘛只能試著走幾步，冒著陷得更快的風險，找下一塊能暫時落腳的彈丸之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......都和我一樣，沒人救我們，就連我們自己也不能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利維亞，你覺得這真的管用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬伊絲的腦波指標穩定一點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給她注射了一些神經抑制劑，這是過去的常規治療手段。雖然這次效果不是特別理想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道她病發另有誘因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她豈不是依然很危險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，解決不了誘因的話，她需要更好的監護環境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好......我本來也並不是在問喬伊絲的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓格雷伊和拓荒者領隊一起巡線......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我派他去的，格雷伊有自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在羅德島本艦待的時間沒有你們長，可我知道羅德島是怎麼行動的。奧利維亞，我不是想指責你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是格雷伊遭遇危險，或者喬伊絲的病情有所耽擱，你不會原諒你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，你覺得那位桑尼先生更容易相信格雷伊，還是我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有差別嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你是在一場萊茵總部的實驗事故裡不幸感染了礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時你有想過......以後可能再也做不了研究嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過很快，老闆——我是說斐爾迪南就給我發了新的合約，把三年續成了十年，順便漲了百分之三十的薪水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一年你還是萊茵年度優秀員工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......這不算安撫吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再怎麼說，我在羅德島治病的那些日子裡，還給主任寫完了三篇論文啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你的想法，因為我也差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遠不及你樂觀純粹，我擔憂過未來，也因此感激過帕爾維斯和萊茵生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我......我也從未懷疑過自己的天賦，以及我的天賦能帶給萊茵生命的回報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病對我們來說是必須要克服的挑戰，它不會蠶食全部的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這就是為何......格雷伊能做到我們都做不到的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼先生，我想指出，您說的話裡有一些互相衝突的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說你們拓荒者是在冒著風險找下一塊落腳之地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您怎麼知道，往我們這邊走一步，就不會是出路呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領隊，你看屋子裡——供電恢復了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，是你——你在跟我說話的同時，還在忙著做這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我當年沒有跑進外面的黑暗裡，就不可能遇上提著燈的羅德島前輩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請相信我，有時候，再走一步真的有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算......我已經站在了懸崖邊緣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哪怕您跳了下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們看到了您伸出來的手。您在向我們求救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就會盡一切努力抓住您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管您遭遇了什麼，都還遠遠沒到放棄的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通電了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格雷伊......成功了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，喬伊絲對光亮有了反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是你，直到此刻都這麼專注。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......女士們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你一個人回來了？格雷伊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前只有這一塊區域通了電，他正在趕往另一片居住區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不信任我，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別過來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利維亞，你說他不會相信我們的話，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更沒有理由相信他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他把我和喬伊絲騙到了這裡，而且我一直沒說......我看見他們派了更多人圍住了實驗區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些拓荒者全都拿著武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情不是你想的那樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想的是什麼樣？你說你不想忘恩負義，難道你忘了多蘿西是怎麼對你們的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們卻為了一己私欲想要傷害她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警報......你拉響了警報？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就想這麼做了。警察和防衛科的同事們一定已經在路上，這下他們不必出動無人機確定我們的方位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還得多謝格雷伊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是故意幫我們恢復供電......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別用你的陰暗心思揣測他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格雷伊是真的想幫助你們，就跟多蘿西和喬伊絲一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在他們的份上，我也會考慮再放你一馬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領隊，無論你們先前有什麼打算，都趁早放棄吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......無人機已經出動了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有，我們的人在等您的指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......基地裡那些會飛的發光點是什麼玩意？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差一點點，馬上就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這光......好、好美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很美嗎？謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......跟著您幹了會活，連身體都更暖和了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來就只剩前面那個點了吧？讓那些大公司的人見鬼去吧，只要我們的雙手還能動，就休想用停止供給來威脅我們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對勁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不要再往前走了，那個光點並不是我的法術！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫默醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還想再問一次，你是不是真的願意相信一名拓荒者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是醫生，也是研究員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的同事們一樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們相信真相。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼有這麼多人在跑動？是不是你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我沒有讓他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，別過來啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是警察來救我們了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，別出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又發什麼瘋——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜是那個東西又來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我本來想告訴你們的......真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，離門遠一些！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領、領隊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......小......心......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是不是受傷了？還是......發病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別靠近他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的隊員很明顯需要幫助！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意他身後——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"形狀不規則的物體懸在半空中。\n它的表面非常光滑，散發著柔和的銀色光芒，此刻正微微起伏著，就如同順應著某種呼吸的節奏。\n從拓荒者背後爬起來之後，它在空中停頓了大約三秒。\n隨後，它緩慢地轉動起自己的身軀，彷彿正好奇地挨個打量在場的人類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快跑！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
